--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This Terraform module distributes only its own configuration source. It does
NOT bundle or redistribute any third-party code. The external Terraform modules,
Terraform providers, Helm charts, and container images that the module references
are fetched at `terraform init` / `terraform apply` from their respective
registries and remain subject to their own licenses — nothing third-party is
included in this repository's published artifact.

For reference, the module deploys the following third-party components, each
